    "problem": "The proposed method of creating thin wool yarn by stretching thicker yarn presents the challenge of determining its effects on the final cloth's quality and wearability, while also overcoming technical difficulties like maintaining adequate twist for practical application.",
    "method": "A method is proposed to create finer wool yarns for lightweight fabrics by taking a comparatively thick wool thread and stretching it out to a thinner dimension.",
    "task": "The task is to evaluate a proposed method of stretching thick wool yarn to produce a thinner, higher-quality thread, and to determine the commercial viability of this technique for manufacturing textiles like lightweight fabrics.",
